:"Trixion","sector":"Sportswear","summary":{"fr":"Built for the bold : une marque de sport vert acide, un F en mouvement, des textiles, accessoires et campagnes urbaines.","en":"Built for the bold: an acid-green sports brand, an F in motion, apparel, accessories and urban campaigns."},"deliverables":{"fr":["Conceptualisation du logo","Moodboard & ton","Textile & accessoires","Campagnes"],"en":["Logo concept","Moodboard & tone","Apparel & accessories","Campaigns"]},"pages":["local:brand/trixion-1","local:brand/trixion-2","local:brand/trixion-3","local:brand/trixion-4","local:brand/trixion-5","local:brand/trixion-6","local:brand/trixion-7","local:brand/trixion-8"]}]'::jsonb) on conflict do nothing;
