{"fr":"Ajoutez et corrigez les sous-titres de votre montage.","en":"Add and correct the captions of your edit."},"question":{"fr":"Pourquoi sous-titrer ?","en":"Why add captions?"},"options":{"fr":["Beaucoup regardent sans le son","Pour cacher l’image","Ce n’est jamais utile"],"en":["Many watch with the sound off","To hide the image","It is never useful"]},"answer":0}]},{"slug":"ia-marketing","title":{"fr":"Intelligence artificielle appliquée au marketing","en":"AI applied to marketing"},"category":{"fr":"IA","en":"AI"},"track":{"fr":"Marketing digital & croissance","en":"Digital marketing & growth"},"level":{"fr":"Avancé","en":"Advanced"},"hours":14,"format":{"fr":"2 jours · 14 h","en":"2 days · 14 h"},"goal":{"fr":"Intégrer les outils d’IA dans sa routine marketing pour gagner du temps et améliorer la qualité.","en":"Bring AI tools into your marketing routine to save time and raise quality."},"why":{"fr":"L’IA transforme le marketing digital : savoir l’utiliser est un avantage concurrentiel immédiat.","en":"AI is transforming digital marketing: using it well is an immediate competitive edge."},"project":{"fr":"Produire une semaine de contenu complet avec l’IA.","en":"Produce a full week of content with AI."},"program":{"fr":["L’IA générative : ce qu’elle est, ce qu’elle n’est pas","Claude, ChatGPT, Midjourney, ElevenLabs…","Textes : posts, articles, scripts, réponses","Images et visuels générés","Automatiser rapports et calendriers","Analyser concurrence et cible","Éthique et limites"],"en":["Generative AI: what it is and is not","Claude, ChatGPT, Midjourney, ElevenLabs…","Text: posts, articles, scripts, replies","Generated images and visuals","Automating reports and calendars","Analysing competitors and audience","Ethics and limits"]},"outcomes":{"fr":["Certificat Smartsell","Supports PDF : cours + exercices","Suivi de 30 jours après la formation"],"en":["Smartsell certificate","PDF materials: lessons + exercises","30-day follow-up after training"]},"photo":"local:labs-night","lessons":[{"title":{"fr":"Un assistant, pas un pilote","en":"An assistant, not a pilot"},"copy":{"fr":"L’IA propose des brouillons rapides ; l’humain choisit, vérifie et signe. Les faits, les chiffres et le ton de marque restent sous votre contrôle.","en":"AI drafts quickly; humans choose, check and sign off. Facts, figures and brand tone stay under your control."},"exercise":{"fr":"Faites rédiger un post par l’IA puis corrigez-le à votre ton.","en":"Have AI draft a post, then rewrite it in your tone."},"question":{"fr":"Qui valide un contenu produit avec l’IA ?","en":"Who approves AI-assisted content?"},"options":{"fr":["Une personne de l’équipe","L’outil lui-même","Personne"],"en":["A person on the team","The tool itself","Nobody"]},"answer":0},{"title":{"fr":"Choisir le bon outil","en":"Picking the right tool"},"copy":{"fr":"Un outil pour le texte, un pour l’image, un pour la voix : chaque besoin a son outil. On commence par la tâche, pas par l’outil à la mode.","en":"One tool for text, one for images, one for voice: each need has its tool. Start from the task, not the trendy tool."},"exercise":{"fr":"Associez trois tâches de votre semaine à un outil adapté.","en":"Match three tasks of your week to a suitable tool."},"question":{"fr":"Par quoi commencer ?","en":"Where should you start?"},"options":{"fr":["Par la tâche à accomplir","Par l’outil le plus cher","Par une tendance"],"en":["With the task at hand","With the most expensive tool","With a trend"]},"answer":0},{"title":{"fr":"Les limites à connaître","en":"Limits to know"},"copy":{"fr":"L’IA peut inventer des faits, reproduire des biais ou exposer des données. On ne lui confie jamais d’informations confidentielles et on vérifie toute affirmation.","en":"AI can invent facts, reproduce bias or expose data. Never give it confidential information, and verify every claim."},"exercise":{"fr":"Listez trois règles d’usage de l’IA pour votre équipe.","en":"List three AI usage rules for your team."},"question":{"fr":"Que faire d’une information produite par l’IA ?","en":"What should you do with AI-generated information?"},"options":{"fr":["La vérifier","La publier telle quelle","L’ignorer toujours"],"en":["Verify it","Publish it as is","Always ignore it"]},"answer":0}]},{"slug":"prompt-engineering","title":{"fr":"Prompt engineering — Parler à l’IA","en":"Prompt engineering — Talking to AI"},"category":{"fr":"IA","en":"AI"},"track":{"fr":"Marketing digital & croissance","en":"Digital marketing & growth"},"level":{"fr":"Avancé","en":"Advanced"},"hours":7,"format":{"fr":"1 jour · 7 h","en":"1 day · 7 h"},"goal":{"fr":"Formuler des instructions précises pour obtenir des résultats IA de haute qualité.","en":"Write precise instructions to get high-quality AI results."},"why":{"fr":"Un bon prompt change tout : c’est la compétence clé pour exploiter l’IA.","en":"A good prompt changes everything: it is the key skill to get the most from AI."},"project":{"fr":"Construire 10 prompts métier pour votre secteur.","en":"Build 10 business prompts for your sector."},"program":{"fr":["Comment fonctionne un modèle de langage, sans jargon","Les 5 composantes : rôle, contexte, tâche, format, contraintes","Chain-of-thought, few-shot, personas, multi-étapes","Prompts pour le contenu marketing","Prompts pour l’analyse et la recherche","Une bibliothèque de prompts réutilisables"],"en":["How a language model works, without jargon","The 5 parts: role, context, task, format, constraints","Chain-of-thought, few-shot, personas, multi-step","Prompts for marketing content","Prompts for analysis and research","A library of reusable prompts"]},"outcomes":{"fr":["Certificat Smartsell","Supports PDF : cours + exercices","Suivi de 30 jours après la formation"],"en":["Smartsell certificate","PDF materials: lessons + exercises","30-day follow-up after training"]},"photo":"local:labs-coder","lessons":[{"title":{"fr":"Les cinq composantes","en":"The five parts"},"copy":{"fr":"Rôle, contexte, tâche, format et contraintes : un prompt complet laisse peu de place au hasard. « Tu es community manager d’une clinique à Conakry… » donne déjà un cadre.","en":"Role, context, task, format and constraints: a complete prompt leaves little to chance. “You are the community manager of a clinic in Conakry…” already sets a frame."},"exercise":{"fr":"Réécrivez une demande vague avec les cinq composantes.","en":"Rewrite a vague request using the five parts."},"question":{"fr":"Quelle composante précise la forme du résultat ?","en":"Which part sets the shape of the result?"},"options":{"fr":["Le format","Le rôle","Le contexte"],"en":["The format","The role","The context"]},"answer":0},{"title":{"fr":"Montrer des exemples","en":"Show examples"},"copy":{"fr":"La technique few-shot consiste à donner deux ou trois exemples de ce que l’on attend. L’IA reprend le ton, la longueur et la structure.","en":"The few-shot technique gives two or three examples of what you expect. The AI picks up tone, length and structure."},"exercise":{"fr":"Ajoutez deux exemples de posts réussis à votre prompt.","en":"Add two examples of successful posts to your prompt."},"question":{"fr":"À quoi servent les exemples ?","en":"What are examples for?"},"options":{"fr":["À montrer le ton et la structure attendus","À rallonger le prompt","À rien"],"en":["Showing the expected tone and structure","Making the prompt longer","Nothing"]},"answer":0},{"title":{"fr":"Une bibliothèque d’équipe","en":"A team library"},"copy":{"fr":"Les prompts qui fonctionnent se rangent et se partagent : nom, usage, prompt, exemple de résultat. L’équipe gagne du temps et garde une qualité constante.","en":"Prompts that work get stored and shared: name, use, prompt, sample result. The team saves time and keeps quality consistent."},"exercise":{"fr":"Rangez vos trois meilleurs prompts dans une fiche partagée.","en":"Store your three best prompts in a shared sheet."},"question":{"fr":"Pourquoi une bibliothèque de prompts ?","en":"Why a prompt 